<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Marka</book>
  <para style="h">Marka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marka</para>
  <para style="mt">Marka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian Fapa, Isua Krista Chanchin Ṭha inṭanna chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabua: ‘Ngai teh, ka tirhkoh i hmaan ka tîr a, Ani chuan i kawng a buatsaih ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thlalêra mi au aw chuan ‘Lalpa lamlian chei ṭha ula, A kal nân kawng tluang siam rawh u,’ tia ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baptistu Johana chuan sual ngaihdam nân sima baptisma chan tûr thu thlalêrah a rawn hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai ram kil tina mi leh Jerusalem khuaa mi zawng zawng chuan amah an pan a, an sualte an puang a, Jordan luiah chuan a lo baptis hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Johana chu sanghâwngsei hmul puanin a inthuam a, savun kâwnghrên a hrêng a, khaukhuap leh ram khawizu chawah a ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kei aia ropui zâwk ka hnungah a lo kal a, kei hi chu kûna a pheikhawk hrui phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keiin tuiin ka baptis che u a, ani erawh chuan Thlarau Thianghlimin a baptis ang che u,” tiin thu a hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng hun lai chuan Isua chu Galili rama Nazaret khua aṭangin a lo kal a, Jordan luiah chuan Johanan a lo baptis a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tui ata a lo chhuah veleh, vân inhawnga Thlarau, ṭhuro anga lo chhuk a hmu a, vân aṭang chuan aw a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nang, ka Fapa, ka Duhtaka chu i ni; i chungah ka lâwm êm êm e,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlarau chuan ani chu thlalêrah a tîr chhuak nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutah chuan ni sawmli Setana thlêmin a awm a; ramsate zîngah a awm ve a, vântirhkohten a rawng an bâwlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Johana chu an man hnuin Isua chu Pathian Chanchin Ṭha hrilin Galili ramah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hun chu a lo thleng ta; Pathian ram pawh a hnai e; sim ula, Chanchin Ṭha hi ring rawh u,” a ti zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Galili dîl kama a kal lai chuan Simona leh a unaupa Andria chu dîla an lên dêng a va hmu a, sangha man mi an ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mi zui rawh u; tichuan, mihring man mi-ah ka lo siam ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An lênte chu an hnutchhiah a, ani chu an zui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A va kal leh hlek a, Zebedaia fa, Jakoba leh Johana te unau chu a hmu a, lawngah lên an lo ṭhui ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anni pawh chu a ko ve nghâl a, an pa Zebedaia leh inhlawhfate chu lawngah an kalsan a, Isua chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Kapernaum khuaah an lût a, Sabat ni chuan Sunagog-ah a zirtîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtute ang lova thunei taka anmahni a zirtîr avâng chuan a zirtîrna chu mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An sunagog-ah chuan thlarau bawlhhlawh pai mi pakhat a lo awm ve a, a au chhuak ta phut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nazaret Isu, kan chungthu-ah rawn inrawlh i tum elo? Min tiboral tûrin i lo kal em ni? Tu nge i nih ka hria Pathian mi thianghlim chu i ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isua chuan a hau va, “Ngawi la, a chhûng ata lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thlarau bawlhhlawh chuan a sawisa nek a, ring taka auvin a chhûng ata chu a lo chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An za chuan mak an ti êm êm a. “Hei eng nge ni ta ngai? Zirtîrna thar a nih hi; thlarau bawlhhlawhte pawh thu nei takin thu a pe a, an awih mai hi,” an inti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Galili ram kil tinah a chanchin chu a thang ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sunagog ata chu a chhuak a, Jakoba leh Johana te nên Simona leh Andria in lam chu an pan nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Simona pizawn chu khawsikin a lo mu reng a, a chanchin an hrilh vat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chuan a va pan a, a kut a chelh a, a kai tho ta a. A khawsik chu a reh ta mai a, chawei a siamsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi tlai, ni tlâk hun chuan, damlo zawng zawng leh ramhuai mante a hnênah an rawn hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a khuain kawngka bulah chuan an lo awm khâwm ta hmur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi tam tak, nat tinrênga nate chu a tidam a, ramhuai tam tak a hnawt chhuak bawk a, amah an hriat avângin ramhuaite chu an ṭawng a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, zîng takah, khua a la ên hmain a tho va, a chhuak a, hmun fianrialah a kal a, chutah chuan a va ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simona leh a ṭhiante chuan an zawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />an va hmuh chuan, “Miin an rawn zawng huai huai che asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hmun dangah, khaw ṭhenawmahte i kal ang u, chûngahte pawh chuan thu ka hril zêl tûr a ni; chu chu ka lo chhuah chhan a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Galili ram zawng zawnga an sunagog-ah lûtin thu a hril zêl a, ramhuaite pawh a hnawt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hnênah phâr a lo kal a, a hmaa ṭhingṭhiin tihdam a ngên chiam a, “I duh chuan mi tithianghlim thei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ani chuan a lo khawngaih êm êm a, a han ban a, a dek a, “Ka duh e, lo thianghlim tawh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A phâr chu a lo dam ta nghâl a, a lo thianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khauh takin thu a pe a, a kaltîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Tu hnênah mah sawi hauh suh; amaherawhchu, puithiam hnênah va inentîr la, i dam ngei tih an hriatna tûrin inthen nâna Mosia thupêk ang khân thil hlân rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ani chu a kal ta a, chu thu chu a sawi a sawi ta mai a, a puang darh ta zâwk a; tichuan, Isua chu khuaah pawh a langin a lût thei ta lo va, hmun fianrialah a awm ta zâwk a; hmun tin aṭangin miin an rawn pan tho va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni eng emawti hnuah chuan Kapernaum-ah a lo lût leh a, ina a awm thu a darh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, pâwnah pawh kawngka bul thleng khat tlatin mi tam tak an lo pung khâwm a, an hnênah chuan thu a hril ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi paliin zeng pakhat an rawn zâwn a, a hnên an rawn panpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipui avâng chuan an hnaih hlei thei lo va, a awmna zâwn in chung chu an ṭhiat a; tin, an ṭhiat zawhin zeng chu a zâwnna chawpin an zu thlâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isuan an rinzia a hmuhin zeng hnênah chuan, “Ka fapa, i sualte ngaihdam a ni ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan Dân zirtîrtu ṭhenkhat ṭhu ve an awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“He mi hian engah nge hetianga a tih le? Pathian pawi a sawi a ni; mi pakhat, Pathian chauh lo chuan, tu nge sualte ngaidam thei?” an ti rilru hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an ngaihtuah tih Isuan a hre nghâl mai a, an hnênah, “Engah nge rilrua chutiang in ngaihtuah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeng hnênah hian, ‘I sualte ngaihdam a ni ta,’ tih nge awl a, ‘Tho la, i mutna kha la la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian Mihring Fapa hian sual a ngaidam thei tih ka han hriattîr ang che u,” a ti a; zeng hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tho la, i mutna kha la la, i inah haw rawh, ka ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, a mutna chu a la a, an vaia hmuhin a chhuak ta nghâl a; an za chuan mak an ti êm êm a, “Hetiang hi kan la hmu ngai rêng rêng lo,” tiin Pathian an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, dîl lamah chuan a kal leh a, mipuiin an rawn pan dûl dûl a, ani chuan a lo zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kal pahin, Alfaia fapa Levia chu chhiah khawnna hmuna ṭhu a hmu a, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a. Ani chu a tho va, a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a inah ruai a ṭheh a, Isua leh a zirtîrte chu chhiahkhawntute leh mi sual tam takin chawhlui an rawn kîlpui hlawm a, tam takin amah an zui ve tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Farisai-te zînga Dân zirtîrtute chuan chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte a kîlpui an hmuh chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Engtizia nge chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte zînga a ei ve le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan chu chu a hriatin an hnênah, “Mi hrisêlten daktor an ngai lo va, mi bawrhsâwmten an ngai zâwk a ni. Mi felte lam tûr ni lovin mi sualte lam tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johana zirtîrte leh Farisai-te chaw nghei ni chuan tute emaw an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Engati nge Johana zirtîrte leh Farisai zirtîrten chaw an nghei a, i zirtîrte lêmin an nghei ve loh?” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan, “An zîngah moneitu a awm chhûng chuan mo hruaitute chuan chaw an nghei ngai em ni? Moneitu chu an awmpui chhûng chu chaw an nghei ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moneitu chu an hnên ata hruai bo hun a la awm ang a, chumi hunah erawh chuan an la nghei ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tu man puan hlui, puan thar la sûk lohvin an bel ngai lo, bel ta sela, a thar chuan puan hlui chu a kai ṭet ang a, a thlêr chu a nasa lehzual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uain thar pawh tu man savun ip hluiah an thun ngai lo, thun ang sela, uain chuan savun ip chu a tâwn keh ang a, uain chu a bua ang a, savun ip pawh chu a chhia ang; uain thar chu savun ip tharahte an thun zâwk ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sabat ni vawi khat chu buhpui hmunahte an kal tlang a, a zirtîrte chuan kal pahin a vuite chu an thliak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Farisai-te chuan a hnênah, “En teh, engtizia nge sabat nia tih thiang lo an tih ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Rilṭâma ei tûr an neih loh laia Davida leh a ṭhiante thil tih kha in chhiar ngai na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abiathara Puithiam lalber a nih laia Pathian ina a luha, puithiamte chauh ei thian chhangdah chu a ei a, a ṭhiante pawh a pêk ve thu kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah vêkin, “Sabat hi mihring tâna siam a ni a, mihring hi sabat tâna siam a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Mihring Fapa hi sabat chungah lam pawh hian Lal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, sunagog-ah a lût a, chutah chuan mi pakhat kut zeng a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah an hêk theih nân sabat nia a tihdam dâwn leh dâwn loh an châng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan kut zeng hnênah chuan, “A laiah hian lo chhuak teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Sabat ni-ah tihṭhat nge thiang tihchhiat? Mi nun chhan nge thiang tihhlum?” tiin anni chu a zâwt a; mahse anni chu an ngawi reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An thinlung sakzia a hriatin pawi a ti êm êm a, thinur taka anmahni a en vêl hnuin chu mi hnênah chuan, “I kut phar rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A han phar chhuak a, a kut chu a lo dam ta a. Farisai-te erawh chu an chhuak a, amah an tihboral theih dân tûr ngaihtuahin Heroda pâwla mite nên chuan an inrâwn ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isua chu a zirtîrte nên dîl kam lamah an kal kiang a; Galili ram aṭangin mipui nasa takin an zui a. Judai ram aṭang te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem aṭang te, Idumea ram aṭang te, Jordan râl aṭang te leh Tura leh Sidon bial aṭang te chuan mipui nasa takin a thiltihte an hria a, amah an rawn pan bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipuiin an rawn nêk chêp luat loh nân lawnglêng lo buatsaih tûrin a zirtîrte chu a hrilh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi tam tak a tihdam tawh avângin na nei apiangin amah deh tumin an bawh huai huai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlarau bawlhhlawhte pawh chuan amah an hriatin an bawkkhup a, “Nang Pathian Fapa chu i ni,” tiin an au ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu nge a nih erawh chu an sawi a khap tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, tlângram lamah a chho va, a mi duhzâwngte chu a ko va, anni chu a hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnêna awma, thu hrila, a tirh tûr,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ramhuaite pawh hnawt chhuak thei tûr mi sâwm leh pahnih a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûngte chu: Simona, Petera a vuah tâk te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebedaia fa Jakoba leh Jakoba unau Johana ‘Boanergia’ tia a vuah tâk te (chu chu ‘Khawpui ri fate’ tihna a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Andria te, Filipa te, Bartholomaia te, Mathaia te, Thoma te, Alfaia fa Jakoba te, Thadaia te, Kanan mi Simona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a mantîrtu Juda Iskariota te chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, inah a haw a, mipui an lo pung khâwm leh ta chiam a, chaw pawh an ei hlei thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chhûngte chuan an hriatin, “A â ta a nih chu,” an ti a, amah hruai tûrin an lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem aṭanga Dân zirtîrtu lo chhuk thlate pawh chuan, “Belzebula a zâwl a nih hi,” te an ti a, “Ramhuai lal avângin alâwm ramhuaite a hnawh chhuah ṭhin,” te an ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni chu a ko va, tehkhin thuin an hnênah, “Setanan Setana vek engtin nge a hnawh chhuah theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram pawh inṭhena mahni an indo chuan chu ram chu a ding thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chhûngkua pawh inṭhena mahni an indo chuan chu mite chhûng chu an ding khawchhuak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Setana pawh mahni inbeiin inkhing ta sela, a ding chhuak thei lo vang, a ral mai zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi chak chu an phuar hmasak zet loh chuan a ina lûtin a sum an lâksak mai thei hek lo, an phuar hnuah erawh chuan a in chu an ramsak thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u; miin sualna zawng zawng leh thil pawi tinrêng an sawite chu ngaihdam theih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim pawi sawi meuh erawh chu, tu mah, engtikah mah ngaihdam an ni lo vang, chatuan sual chu an ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Thlarau bawlhhlawh a zâwl a ni,” an tih avâng khân chu chu a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nu leh a unaute chu an lo thleng a, pâwnah an ding a, amah an kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A vêla mipui ṭhute chuan a hnênah, “En teh, pâwna saw, i nu leh i unaute leh i farnuten an ko va che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, “Ka nu leh ka unaute chu tute nge ni?” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a kianga ṭhute chu a han en vêl a, “En teh u, ka nu leh ka unaute hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian duhzâwng ti chu, chu mite ngei chu, ka unau te, ka farnute, ka nu te an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dîl kamah chuan a zirtîr leh ta a; mipui nasa tak an lo pung khâwm a, dîla lawngah chuan a chuang a, a ṭhu a; mipui zawng zawng chu dîl kam khawmualah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tehkhin thuin thu tam tak a zirtîr a, a zirtîr lai chuan an hnênah, “Ngai thla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Buh chi thehtu buh chi thehin a feh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a han theh chuan a ṭhen kalkawngah a tla a, savaten an rawn tlân zo ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ṭhen pialtlêp chung lei pan hmunah a tla a, lei a chhah lo va, a lo ṭo thuai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, ni a lo tlângsâng deuh va, a em vuai a, zung a kaih loh avângin a râwp ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhen hnimhlîngnei zîngah a tla a, hnim chu a lo ṭhang a, a dîp ral a, a rah thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chu lei ṭhaah a tla a, a ṭo va, a ṭhang lian a, a rah ta a; a let sawmthum te, a let sawmruk te, a let za te a lo haw ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A fâla a awm hnu chuan Sâwmpahnihte leh a ṭhuihruai dangte chuan tehkhin thute chu an zâwt fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Pathian ram thu ril chu in hnêna pêk a ni a; pâwna mite tân erawh chuan tehkhin thu veka sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘En fo siin an hmu fuh lo vang a, Ngaithla ngaithla siin a ngaihna an hre hek lo vang; Chuti ni lo sela chu an lo hawi kîr ang a, Ngaihdam an ni tûr,’ tih ang kha a nih theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah vêk chuan, “He tehkhin thu hi in hrethiam lo maw? Engtin nge tehkhin thu dang rêng rêng in hriatthiam theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Buh chi thehtu chuan thu chu a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kalkawnga tlate chu hetiang hi an ni: thu chu an hriatin Setana a lo kal thuai a; anmahnia thu theh chu a lâk zawhsak nghâl mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin pialtlêp hmuna thehte chu hetiang hi an ni: thu chu an hriat veleh lâwm takin an pawm nghâl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nimahsela, anmahniah chuan zung a kai lo va, rei lo tê chauh an daih a, chumi hnuah chuan thu avânga hrehawm emaw, tihduhdahna emaw a lo awm veleh an tlu nghâl mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnimhlîngnei zînga thehte pawh chu hêng mite ang hi an ni: thu chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahse, khawvêl lungkhamna te, hausak nawmchenna te, thil dang châkna te a lo lût a, thu chu a rawn dîp ral a, a rah ta ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lei ṭha a thehte erawh chu: thu chu hriaa, pawma, a lêt sawmthum te, a lêt sawmruk te leh a lêt za tea rah tate hi an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah vêkin an hnênah, “Khâwnvâr hi khova khuh tûrin emaw, khum hnuaia dah tûrin emaw an rawn chhi ngai em ni? A dahnaa dah tûr a ni dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eng mah puan loh tûra thuhrûk a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah, “In thil ngaihthlâk chu ngai ngun rawh u, in tehna ngaiin an tehsak ang che u, an pe tam zâwk mah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nei an pêk belhchhah ang a, a nei lo chu a neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah vekin an hnênah, “Pathian ram chu miin a lovah chi a theh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />zânah a mutsan a, chhûnah a tho va, chi chu engtia lo ṭiaka, lo ṭhang nge tih a hre lo ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lei chuan amahin rah a rawn chhuahtîr mai ṭhîn, a tîr berah a kûng, a dawtah a vui, chumi zawhah a vuia a fang pum chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A rah chu a lo hmin a, seng a lo hun tâk avângin a favahin a ât nghâl ṭhîn,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin, “Pathian ram chu eng nên nge kan teh anga, eng tehkhin thu hmangin nge kan sawi fiah ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anṭam chi fang ang hi a ni, an theh lai chuan leia chi zawng zawnga tê ber a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />an han theh hnu chuan thlai dang zawng zawng aia lianin a lo ṭhang a, zâr lian tak takte a rawn chhuah a, chunglêng savate pawh a bukah chuan an riak thei ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutiang tehkhin thu tam tak hmang chuan an hriatthiam tâwk tûrin thu chu an hnênah a sawi ṭhin a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tehkhin thu lo chuan an hnênah thu a sawi ngai lo; ama zirtîrte hnênah erawh chuan fianrialah engkim a hrilh fiah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chumi nia khua a lo tlai lam chuan an hnênah, “Râl lehlamah sâwn i kai ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipuite chu an kalsan a, a chuanna lawng chuan ani chu an kalpui a, lawng dangte pawh an tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, thlipui na tak a lo tleh ta a, tuifâwnte chu lawngah a rawn invawrh lût a, a khat dâwn ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ani chu lawng mei lamah lukham khamin a lo muhîl a. An han kai tho va, “Zirtîrtu, kan boral dâwn hi, pawi i ti lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ani chu a lo tho va, thli chu a hau va, dîl hnênah pawh chuan, “Ngawi la, awm hle hle rawh,” a ti a. Thli chu a bâng a, a lo reh ta ṭhup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Engah nge in hlauh? Rinna rêng in la nei na nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An hlau ta êm êm a, “He mi hi tu nge ni le! Thli leh dîl lam pawhin a thu an awih hi?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dîl râl Gerasin mite ram chu an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawng ata a chhuak chu thlarau bawlhhlawh pai mi pakhat, thlân hmun aṭanga lo kal chuan, a rawn pan vat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi chu thlânahte a chêng ṭhîn a, tu mahin khaidiat pawhin an phuar thei lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />khaidiata phuarin kawlte buntîr ṭhîn mah se, khaidiatte chu a pawt chat a, kawlte chu a tisawm ṭhîn; tu mah tudawl thei an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chhûn a zân mai hian thlânahte leh tlângahte chuan a au a au ṭhîn a, lungte pawhin a inzai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hla tak aṭangin Isua chu a hmu a, a lam panin a tlân a, kûnin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ring takin a au va, “Isu, Chungnungbera Pathian Fapa, kan chungthu-ah rawn inrawlh i tum elo? Mi nghaisa lul lo tûrin Pathian hmingin ka ngên a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani lah chuan, “Thlarau bawlhhlawhpa, a chhûng ata kha lo chhuak rawh,” a lo ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“I hming eng nge ni?” tiin a zâwt a. Ani chuan, “Ka hming chu Sângruka a ni, kan tam êm êm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi ram ata tichhuak lo tûrin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi tlâng pangah chuan vawk rual tam deuh mai an tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnênah chuan, “Vawk hnênah sâwn min kaltîr la, an kawchhûngah kan va lût ang e,” tiin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isuan a phalsak ta a. Tichuan, thlarau bawlhhlawh chu an lo chhuak a, vawk kawchhûngah chuan an lût a. Vawk rual chu sânghnih lai an ni, khâm kovah chuan an tlân liam a, dîlah chuan an tla hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A vêngtute chu an tlânchhia a, khua leh a chhehvêla mite chu an va hrilh a. Tichuan, eng thil nge lo thleng ta tih en tûrin an lo kal hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isua hnên an lo thlen chuan ramhuai man, Sângruka kha, puan sina rilru pangngai pua lo ṭhu an va hmu a; hlauhawm an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng hmutute chuan ramhuai man chunga thil thlengte leh vawk chanchinte chu an lo hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan Isua chu an bial ata chhuak tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isua chu lawnga a chuan dâwn laiin ramhuai mana khân a hnêna awm reng a ngên a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mahse, a phal lo va, “I inah, i chhûngte hnênah haw la, Lalpan i tân thil a tihsak che leh a khawngaihzia che hi va hrilh zâwk tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chu a kal a, Dekapoli khuaahte chuan Isuan thil a tihsakte chu a tlângaupui ta a, mi zawng zawngin mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu lawnga râl lehlama a kai leh chuan mipui nasa tak a hnênah an lo pung khâwm a; dîl kamah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sunagog hotu zînga pakhat, a hming Jaira chu a lo kal a, amah a han hmuh chuan a ke bulah a bawkkhup a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka fanu naupang tê a thi lek lek a, a lo harh a, a lo dam leh theih nân a chungah i kut va nghat teh,” tiin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isua chuan a zui ta a, mipui nasa takin amah chu an zui ve a, an nêk huai huai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmeichhe pakhat, kum sâwm leh pahnih thi pût tawh hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Daktor tam takin nasa takin an enkawl tawh a, a neih zawng zawng a hman ral hnu pawhin ṭhat lam pan ahnêkin a zual zâwk mah si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isua chanchin a lo hriat veleh chuan hnung lamah mipui kârah chuan a lo kal a, a puan chu a va dek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A puan chauh pawh dek ila ka dam ngei ang,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, chawplehchilhin a thi pût chu a lo hul ta a, a na chu a dam ta tih a taksaah chuan a inhre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isua pawh chuan amah aṭangin thiltihtheihna a chhuak tih a inhre nghâl a, mipui zîngah chuan a hawi vêl a, “Tu nge ka puan dek kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan “Mipuiin an nêk huai huai che i hmu si a, engtizia nge ‘tu nge mi dek?’ i tih le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a dektu hmuh tumin a en vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, a chunga thil lo thleng ta chu hriain hmeichhia chu hlau leh khûr chungin a lo kal a, a hmaah a bawkkhup a, engkim dik takin a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka fanu, i rinna hi i dam phah a ni e, thlamuang takin kal ta la, i natna ata chu lo dam hlen tawh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A la ṭawng lai mêk chuan Jaira in aṭanga lo kalte chuan, “I fanu a thi ta. Engah nge zirtîrtu hi i la tihhah cheu dâwn?” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan an thu sawi chu a lo hre ve a, sunagog hotupa hnênah chuan, “Hlau suh, ring mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Petera te, Jakoba te, Jakoba unau Johana te chauh lo chu mi dang tu mahin an zui ve a phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sunagog hotupa in chu an va thleng a, ri mur mur leh ṭap tuar tuara chiau vawng vawngte chu a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A luh pah chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge in buaia in ṭah vak vak le? Naupang chu a thi lo ve, a muhîl a ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Anni chuan an nuihsan mai a. Tichuan, an za-in a hnawt chhuak a, naupang nu leh pa leh amah zuitute chu a hruai a, naupang mutna hmunah chuan an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, naupang kut chu a chelh a, a hnênah, “Talitha, kum,” a ti a, chu chu, “Mami, tho rawh,” tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hmeichhe naupang chu a lo tho va, a kal thei ta mai a, amah chu kum sâwm leh pahnih mi a ni. Mak an ti nasa êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Hei hi tu man hre suh se,” a ti tlat a. “Ei tûr pe rawh u,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chu hmun chu a chhuahsan a, an khaw lamah a kal ta a, a zirtîrte pawh chuan an zui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabat ni a lo ni a, sunagog-ah chuan a han zirtîr ṭan ta a; mi tam tak an awm a, a thu an hriat chuan mak an ti êm êm a, “Hêng hi khawi aṭanga a hriat nge? A dawn hi eng finna nge ni-a, chuti kauva thiltihtheihna a neih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mari fa, Jakoba te, Josea te, Juda te, Simona te unaupa mistiri kha a ni lo vem ni? A farnute pawh kan zîngah an awm lo vem ni?” te an ti a; amah chu an hmu thiam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua chuan an hnênah, “Zâwlnei chu ama khaw lamah te, a laichîn te leh a chhûngte zîngah lo chuan an chawimawi ṭhîn.” a tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, damlo tlêm te chunga kut nghata a tihdam chauh lo chu chutah chuan thil mak rêng a ti thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An rin loh avâng chuan mak a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, zirtîr chung zêlin khuate a fang vêl a. Sâwmpahnihte chu a ko va, pahnih zêla inkawpin a tîr chhuak a, thlarau bawlhhlawhte chunga thuneihna pawh a pe bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kalkawng atân tiang chauh lo chu chhang pawh, iptê pawh, an kâwnghrênah pawisa pawh pai lo tûrin a ti tlat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />pheikhawk an bun a phal a, kawr pahnih an hâk erawh chu a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “In chhuahsan leh hma chu in va thlen in ngaiah chuan chêng reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawii khua pawhin an lawm loh che ua, in thu an ngaihthlâk loh chuan, chu khua in chhuahsan dâwnah, an tihdik lohzia hriattîr nân in kephaha vaivut chu thing thla ang che u,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, an kal chhuak a, “Sim rawh u,” tiin thu an hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ramhuai tam tak an hnawt chhuak a, damlo tam tak hriak an hnawih a, an tidam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isua hming chu a than tâk êm avângin Lal Heroda chuan a lo hre ve ta a. Mi ṭhenkhat, “Baptistu Johana kha mitthi zîng ata a lo tho leh ta a, hêng thiltihtheihnate hian amahah a thawk a nih chu,” tite an awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mi dangin, “Elija a nih chu” an ti a; a ṭhenin, “Zâwlnei, hmânlai zâwlnei zînga pakhat ang kha a nih chu,” te an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Heroda erawh chuan a lo hriatin, “Johana, a lu ka tansak kha a ni ang, a lo tho leh ta a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He Heroda hi a ni, a unau Filipa nupui, Herodi, nupuia neihsaktu, chumi avâng chuan Johana chu a mantîr a, tân inah a khung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johana chuan Heroda hnênah, “I unau nupui i chhuhsak hi a thiang lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Herodi chuan a hal ta riau a, tihhlum pawh a duh a; mahse, a thei si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Herodan Johana chu mi fel leh mi thianghlim a nih a hria a, a ṭih êm êm a, a hum tlat a ni; a thu a ngaihthlâk chuan a inngaihtuah buai hle ṭhîn a; mahse, châk takin a ngaithla ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Heroda chuan a mi ropui te, sipai hotu lian te, Galili rama mi liante a sâwm a, a pian champhaphâk ruai a ṭheh lai chuan hun remchâng a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Herodi fanu chu a lo lût a, a lâm a, Heroda leh a ruai kîlpuite chu a tilâwm ta hle a; lal chuan nula hnênah chuan, “I duh apiang mi dîl rawh, ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Eng pawh mi dîl apiang, ka ram chanve hial pawh ka pe ang che,” tiin a tiam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani chu a chhuak a, a nu hnênah chuan, “Eng nge ka dîl ang?” a va ti a. A nu chuan, “Baptistu Johana lu le,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmanhmawh takin lal hnênah chuan a kîr leh a, “Thlêngah Baptistu Johana lu mi pe nghâl rawh,” a ti a. Lal chuan pawi a ti êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />mahse, a thutiam leh a ruai kîlpuite avâng chuan a hnial hreh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chuan vêngtu sipai pakhat a tîr ta nghâl a; tân inah chuan Johana lu chu a tan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />thlêngin a rawn la a, nula chu a pe a, ani chuan a nu a pe leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu chu a zirtîrten an hriatin an va kal a, a ruang chu an hlâwm a, thlânah an zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tirhkohte kha Isua hnênah an lo kal khâwm a, an thil tih apiangte leh an thu, zirtîr zawng zawng chu an hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Keimahniho chauhvin fianrialah kal hrang ila, in châwl rih dâwn nia,” a ti a. Mi tam tak an insûl zut zut a, chaw takngial pawh an ei hman si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, fianrial pan chuan lawngin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An chhuak chu mi tam takin an hmu a, anni an ni tih an hriat chuan khawmual lamah, khaw tin aṭangin, an tlân khâwm a, an lo lehkhalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lawng ata a lo chhuah chuan mipui nasa tak a hmu a, vêngtu nei lo berâm ang an nih avângin a khawngaih ta êm êm a, ṭhahnemngai takin a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khua pawh a lo tlai ta hle a, a zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Hei hi hmun thlalêr a ni a, khua pawh a lo tlai ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />kan kiang vêl lovahte leh khuaahte mahni ei tûr eng emaw tal an zawn theih nân anniho hi kaltîr ta che,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Nangmahnin ei tûr pe zâwk rawh u,” tiin a lo chhâng a. Anni chuan, “Chhang duli zahnih man leiin ei tûr kan pe em ni ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ani chuan, chhang eng zât nge in neih, han en teh u,” a ti a. An neih zât an han hriat chuan, “Tlang nga, sangha pahnih nên,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ani chuan an vaiin hlobet hring hmunah chuan a pâwl pâwla ṭhuttîr tûrin zirtîrte chu thu a pe ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />za te, sawmnga tein an ṭhu ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ani chuan chhang panga leh sangha pahnih chu a la a, vân lam enin malsâwmna a sawi a, chhang chu a phel a, mipui hnêna sem tûrin zirtîrte chu a pe a; sangha pawh chu a sem ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An zavai chuan an ei a, an tlai ta ṭheuh va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />chhang leh sangha sem bâng chu bâwm sâwm leh pahnihah an dah khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chhang eitute chu patling hlîr pawh sângnga an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mipuite chu a ṭintîr vêl chhûngin râl lehlam Bethsaida-a lo va kal hmasa tûrin a zirtîrte chu lawngah a chuan luihtîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mipui chu a thlah fel hnu chuan ṭawngṭai tûrin tlângah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Khua a lo thim a, lawng chu dîl laiah a awm tawh a, ani erawh chu amah chauhvin khawmualah a la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Thliin a ni lo lama a nem avâng chuan mangang taka lawng an kar chu a hmu a; khawfîng chah dâwn vêlin dîl chungah chuan an lam panin a kal a, kal pelh a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Dîl chunga a kal an hmuh chuan hmuithla emaw an ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />hlauvin an au ta chûl a. “Thlaphâng suh u, keimah ka ni e, hlau mah ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Lawngah chuan a chuang lût ve ta a, thli pawh chu a bâng ta mai a. Tichuan, mak an ti êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />chhang thu kha a awmzia an hre si lo va, an rilruin a man pha lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Dîl an kân a, Genesaret ramah chuan an va kai a, lawng chu an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Lawng ata chu an chhuak a, miten ani chu an lo hre nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chumi bial pumah chuan an tlân ta sung sung a, a awma an hriatna apiangah damlote chu an mutna chawpin an zâwn khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Khaw tê-ah te, khaw lianah te, lovah te, khawiah pawh a kalna apiangah damlote chu an bazâr hmunahte an muttîr a, a puanfêm pawh deh theih an ngên hlawm a; tin, a dek apiang chu an dam ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Farisai-te chu, Dân zirtîrtu ṭhenkhat Jerusalem aṭanga lo kalte nên a hnênah an lo kal ho va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a zirtîr ṭhenkhatten kut bawlhhlawha chaw an ei chu an hmu a, chu chu ‘kut sil loh’ tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farisai-te bâkah Juda-ho zawng zawng pawhin upate thu rochhiah zâwmin kut an sil zet loh chuan eng mah an ei ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An bazâr kai haw pawh an insil zet loh chuan eng mah an ei ngai lo. Thil dang tam tak pawh zawm tûr dawn chhâwn an nei - no sil te, bêl sil te, khum sil ang te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Farisai-te leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan, “Engati nge i zirtîrte hian upa thu rochhiah zâwm lovin kut bawlhhlawha chaw an ei ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Nangni mi vervêkho thu Isaian hetia a lo hril lâwk hi a tidik zet mai: ‘He mite hian an ṭawngkam chauhvin mi chawimawi a. An thinlung erawh chuan mi hlat si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thurin ang hrimin mihring thupêkte an zirtîr a, An mi biakna hi a thlâwn mai a ni,’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian thupêkte in hlamchhiah a, mihring thu rochhiah te chu in vuan tlat a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah vêkin, “Nangmahni thu rochhiah in kenkawh theih nân Pathian thupêk hêl dân in thiam teh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia chuan, ‘I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh, mahni nu emaw, pa emaw sawichhia chu a thi ngei tûr a ni,’ a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nangni erawh chuan, miin a nu emaw, a pa emaw hnênah, ‘Mi chhawrna tûr zawng zawng Korban (chu chu ‘Pathian hnêna pêk’ tihna a ni) a ni tawh,’ a tih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a nu tân emaw, a pa tân emaw eng mah a tihsak in phal tawh ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, in thu rochhiah avâng hian Pathian thu chu in bawh bo a nih hi, chutiang chu tam tak in ti ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipuite chu a ko khâwm leh a, an hnênah, “In za-in ka thu hi ngaithla ula, hei hi hre fiah rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />pâwn lam aṭanga mihring chhûnga lût eng mahin amah a tibawlhhlawh thei lo, mihring chhûng lam aṭanga lo chhuak zâwk chu a ni amah tibawlhhlawh ṭhîntu chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipui chu ina a luhsan hnuin a zirtîrte chuan tehkhin thu chu an zâwt fiah ta a. Ani chuan, “Nangni pawh chuti êma mâwl in ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng pawh pâwn lam ata mihring chhûnga lût apiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a thinlung chhûnga lût lovin a pum chhûngah a lût zâwk a, dailênnaah a chhuah leh mai avângin amah chu a tibawlhhlawh thei lo tih in hre lâwm ni?” a ti a. (Chutiang chuan ei tûr tinrêng hi a sawi thiang ta vek a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihring chhûng lam aṭanga lo chhuak chuan chumi ngei chuan, mihring hi a tibawlhhlawh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring thinlung chhûng lam aṭang chuan ngaihtuahna sual - inngaihna te, rûkrûkna te, tualthahna te, uirena te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />awhna te, suahsualna te leh bumna te, hurna te, îtsîkna te, Pathian pawi sawina te, chapona te, ho taka chêtna te a lo chhuak si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hêng thil sual zawng zawng hi chhûng lam aṭanga lo chhuak a ni a, mihring a tibawlhhlawh ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tho va, chuta ṭang chuan Tura bialah a kal ta a; in pakhatah a va awm a, tu ma hriat a duh lo na a, a inthup hlei thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlarau bawlhhlawh pai fanu nei nu pakhat pawh chuan a chanchin a lo hriat veleh a rawn pan a, a ke bulah chuan a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu nu chu Grik a ni a, Suria rama Foiniki biala piang a ni. A fanu kawchhûng ata ramhuai chu hnawt chhuak tûrin a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a hnênah, “Fate chu tlai phawt rawh se, fate chaw lâksaka, ui hnêna pêk chu a dik lo ve,” a lo tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “A ni khawp mai, Lalpa; nimah sela, dawhkân hnuaia uite pawhin fate ei nawi tlate chu an ei ṭhîn alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“I thu sawi avâng chuan haw ta la, ramhuai chu i fanu kawchhûng ata a chhuak tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chu a hâwng a, a fa chu khuma a mu a va hmu a, ramhuai chuan a lo chhuahsan tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tura bial aṭang chuan a chhuak leh a, Sidon tlawhin Dekapoli bial chu kal tlangin Galili dîl a lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bengngawng pakhat, ṭawng pawh ṭawng fiah thei lo hi a hnênah an rawn hruai a, a chunga kut nghat tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Isua chuan mipui zîng ata chu a hruai hrang a, a kut zung chuan a beng kuate chu a khawihsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a leiah chil a hnawmsak a, vân lam enin a thaw huai a, a hnênah, “Effata,” a ti a, (chu chu ‘lo inhawng rawh,’ tihna a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, a beng chu a lo vâr a, a lei phuarna te pawh chu a lo inphelh a, fiah takin a ṭawng thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu mah hrilh lo tûrin anniho chu a ti tlat a; nimahsela, a khap nasat veleh an tlângaupui zual sauh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mak an ti nasa êm êm a, “Thil a va han ti ṭha ṭhîn tak êm! Bengngawng beng a tivâr a, ṭawngtheilote pawh a ṭawngtîr hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih lai vêl chuan mipui nasa tak an lo pung khâwm leh a, ei tûr eng mah an nei lo va. A zirtîrte chu a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipuiho hi ka khawngaih êm êm a ni, ka hnênah ni thum an awm tawh a, ei tûr lah an nei ta si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />rilṭâma ka hawtîr mai chuan kawng lakah an ṭâmchhâwl mai ang, ṭhenkhatte phei chu an lo kalna a hla hle si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan, “Tu nge hetiang hmun thlalêrah hêngho puarna khawp chhang hmu thei ang?” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Chhang eng zât nge in neih?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Pasarih,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui chu leia ṭhu tûrin thu a pe a, chhang pasarih chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a phel a, an hnêna sem tûrin a zirtîrte a pe a; mipui chu an sem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nghatê tlêm an nei bawk a, chûng pawh chu malsâwmna a sawi zawhin a semtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, an ei a, an tlai ta hlawm a. An sem bâng chu bâwm sarihah an dah khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipuite chu sângli lai an ni; anniho chu a ṭîntîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ani pawh chu a zirtîrte nên lawngah an chuang ve nghâl a, Dalmanutha ram an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farisai-te an lo kal a, an rawn hnial a. Amah fiah nân vân ata chhinchhiahna thil mak an phût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thaw ipikthlâk a ti hle a, “Engati nge tûnlai mite hian chhinchhiahna thil mak an zawn? Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, tûnlai mite hi chhinchhiahna thil mak rêng rêng entîr an ni lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anni chu a kalsan a, lawngah chuan a chuang leh a, râl lehlam panin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan chhang an lo ken theihnghilh a, lawngah chuan chhang tlang khat chauh lo chu a dang rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Farisai-te dawidim leh Heroda dawidim lakah chuan invêng ula, fîmkhur rawh u,” tiin anni chu a han zilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chhang kan nei hauh lo mai le,” tiin an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan a lo hriatin, “Engati nge chhang in neih loh thu ngawt in buaipui tâk? In la man lovin in la hrethiam lo ta cheu a ni maw? In va ngawng ve maw le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mit nei siin in hmu lo maw? Beng nei siin in hre lo maw? In theihnghilh ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhang pangaa mi sângnga ka hrai ṭum khân eng zât nge bâng kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bâwm sâwm leh pahnih,” an ti a. “A nih leh, mi sângli chhang pasariha ka hrai khân eng zât nge bâng kha?” a ti a. “Bâwm sarih,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, an hnênah, “In la hrethiam lo ta cheu maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bethsaida chu an lo thleng a, a hnênah mitdel an rawn hruai a, amah dek tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan mitdel kut chu a chelh a, khua ata chu a kai chhuak a. A mitah chil a chhâk a, a khawih a, “Khua i hmu thei em?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani chu a han dâk a, “Mi ka hmu, thing angin an kal zut zut mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A mit chu a khawihsak leh a, a han meng vak a, a lo dam felin engkim fiah takin a hmu thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Khuaah pawh lût lovin haw nghâl rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isua leh a zirtîrte chu Filipa Kaisari chhehvêl khuaahte chuan an kal ta a. Kawngah chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Miten tu nge nia mi sawi?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anni chuan, “ ‘Baptistu Johana,’ ti che an awm a, a ṭhenin ‘Elija,’ an ti che a, ṭhenkhat erawh chuan, ‘Zâwlnei tu-a emaw’ te an ti che,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A nih, nangnin tu nge nia mi hriat?” tiin a zâwt a. Petera chuan, “Krista chu i ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, a chanchin chu tu mah hrilh tawp lo tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Mihring Fapa chuan thil tam tak tuar ngei tûr a nih thu te, upate, puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtuten an duh loh tûr thu te, an thah ngei tûr thu te, ni thum china a thawhleh ngei tûr thu te chu a zirtîr ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûng thu chu chiang takin a sawi a. Petera erawh chuan ani chu a hruai hrang a, a zilhhau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani chuan a hawisan a, a zirtîrte lam chu a hawi a, “Setan, kal bo daih rawh, Pathian duh dâna ngaihtuah lovin mihring duh dânin i ngaihtuah a nih hi,” tiin Petera chu a hau ve ta thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipui chu a zirtîrte nên chuan a ko va, an hnênah, “Tu pawh mi zui duh chuan mahni inngaihtuah chang lovin mahni kraws puin mi zui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tu pawh mahni nun humhim tum chuan an chân ang a, tu pawh keimah avâng leh Chanchin Ṭha avânga nun chân chuan an humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Miin khawvêl hi a pumin nei vek sela a nun chân si se, a tân eng nge sâwt ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Miin a nun aiah eng nge a pêk theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tûnlai mi, uire hmang leh sual tak zînga ka thu leh kei mi zahpui apiang chu Mihring Fapa pawh hian Vântirhkoh thianghlimte nêna a Pa ropuina nên a lo kal hunah chuan anni chu a zahpui ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, heta dingho ṭhenkhatte hi, Pathian ram thiltihtheihna nêna lo thleng an hmuh hma loh chu thi lo tûr an awm,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ni ruk hnu chuan Isuan Petera te, Johana te leh Jakoba te chu tlâng sâng takah hruaiin anmahni chauh a chhohpui a; an hmaah chuan a hmêl lan dân a lo danglam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A silhfênte pawh chu, leia puan su tu rêng rêngin an sûk vâr theih loh khawpin a lo vâr ta sur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elija leh Mosia chu an hnênah an rawn inlâr a, Isua nên an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Petera chuan Isua hnênah, “Rabi, heta kan awm hi a ṭha e; bâwktê pathum kan khawh ang e, i tân pakhat, Mosia tân pakhat, Elija tân pakhat,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hlauh êm avângin sawi tûr ahleih pawh an hre lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chhûm a lo zîng a, anniho chu a rawn khuh a, chhûm aṭang chuan aw a lo chhuak a, “Hei hi ka Fapa, ka Duhtaka chu a ni, ama thu hi ngai rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, an han en vêl thuai a, an zîngah chuan Isua chauh lo chu tu mah dang an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlâng ata chu an chhuk laiin Mihring Fapa chu mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh hma chuan an thil hmuhte chu tu mah hrilh hauh lo tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, chu thu chu an vawng reng a, ‘Mitthi zîng ata thawhleh,’ tih chu eng tihna ni ang maw tiin an sawi ho ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Engtizia nge Dân zirtîrtuten, ‘Elija a lo kal hmasa zet tûr a ni’ an tih le?” tiin Isua chu an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Elija chu engkim siam ṭha tûra lo kal hmasa rêng tûr alâwm. Engtizia nge Mihring Fapa hi thil tam tak tuara hmuhsitin a awm dâwn a ni tih ziak a nih si le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Elija chu a lo kal tawh a, a chanchin ziak ang ngei khân a chungah an duh duhin an tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte hnên an zu thleng a, an vêla mipui nasa tak chu an hmu a, Dân zirtîrtute nên an lo inhnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah an hmuh veleh mipui zawng zawng chuan mak an ti hle a; a hnên lamah an tlân a, chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Hêngho nên hian eng thu-ah nge in lo inhnial?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipui zînga pakhat chuan a chhâng a, “Zirtîrtu, ka fapa, ramhuai ṭawngtheilo pai chu, i hnênah ka rawn hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a man apiangin a paih tlu ṭhîn a; a chil phuante a tla a, a hâte a ṭhial a, a khawng tlat mai ṭhîn. I zirtîrte hi hnawt chhuak tûrin ka ti a, an thei si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ṭhangthar, rinna tlachhamte u, eng chen nge in hnêna ka awm anga, eng chen nge ka dawh theih dâwn che u? Ka hnênah han hruai teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnênah chuan an hruai a, ramhuai bawlhhlawh chuan Isua a hmuh veleh naupang chu a sawisa ta nghâl a; tichuan, leiah a tlu a, chilphuan tla zawih zawihin a tâl ta awrh awrh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pa chu, “Eng chen nge hetianga a awm tawh?” tiin a zâwt a. Ani chuan, “A naupan têt ata a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meiah te, tuiah te amah tiboral tûrin a nam thlu fo ṭhîn; nimahsela, nangin engtin emaw tal i tih theih chuan khawngaih takin mi pui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isua chuan a hnênah, “I theih chuan â maw! Ringtu tân chuan engkim hi tih theih asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Naupang pa chuan, “Ka ring e. Rinna ka tlâkchham avâng hian min pui ang che,” tiin a au chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipui an lo tlân khâwm tup tup chu a hmuhin Isua chuan ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu a hau va, “Nang, ramhuai ṭawngtheilo leh bengngawng, thu ka pe a che, a chhûng ata kha lo chhuak la, lût leh tawh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ramhuai chu a au chhuak a, a nghaisak nek hnuin a lo chhuak ta a. Naupang chu thi ang maiin a awm a, mi tam tak phei chuan, “A thi ta a ni,” an ti hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a kut a chelh a, a kai tho va, a lo ding chhuak ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isua chu inah a lût a, a zirtîrten, “Engati nge keinin kan hnawh chhuah theih loh le?” tiin a fâlin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hetiang hi zawng ṭawngṭaina chauh lo chuan engti dang mahin a hnawh chhuah theih loh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta chu an chhuak a, Galili ram chu an kal tlang a; chu chu tu ma hriat a duh lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a zirtîrte chu thil zirtîr a nei a ni; an hnênah chuan, “Mihring Fapa hi mihringte kutah mantîr a ni dâwn a, an tihlum ang; mahse, an tihhlum hnu ni thum chinah a tho leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anni chuan a thu sawi chu a ngaihna an hre lo va, amah lah chu an zâwt ngam bawk si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kapernaum chu an lo thleng a, in chhûnga a luh hnu chuan an hnênah, “Kalkawngah khân eng thu-ah nge in inhnial le?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kawngah chuan, ‘kan zîngah tu nge ropui ber ang?’ tia an lo inhnial avâng khân an ngawi ta reng hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ani chu a ṭhu tê tê a, Sâwmpahnihte chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Tu pawh hmasa ber nih duh chu hnuhnûng berah an awm tûr a ni, mi zawng zawng rawngbâwltuah an awm bawk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Naupang tê a kai a, an zîngah chuan a dintîr, a kuangkuah a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Tu pawh ka hming avânga hetiang naupang tê pakhat pawh lâwm chu kei mi lâwm an ni; tu pawh kei mi lâwm chu kei mi lâwm ni lovin mi tîrtu lâwm an ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Johana chuan, “Zirtîrtu, tu emaw i hminga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak kan hmu a, kan zînga a zui ve loh che avângin khap kan lo tum asin,” tiin a han hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Khap suh u, tu mah ka hminga thil mak ti si-a mi rêl zui nghâl thei an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Min dodâl lo chu kan lamṭang an ni ngai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Krista mi in nih avânga tui in tûr no khat pe apiang che u chuan an lâwm man tûr an chân tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tu pawh hêng ringtu zînga tê ber pakhat pawh titlu chu, an nghâwngah chhangphut râwtna lung lian pui awrhtîrin tuifinriatah thlâk ni se an tân a ṭha zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />I kutin a tihtlûk che chuan tân mai rawh, kut pahnih neia Gehena mei mit thei lova kal ai chuan piangsuala nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />I ke pawhin a tihtlûk che chuan tân mai rawh, ke pahnih neia Gehena-a paih nih ai chuan ke bûla nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />I mit pawhin a tihtlûk che chuan kher chhuak mai rawh, mit khing hnih neia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />thil lungin a kher rengna hmun leh meiin a kan rengna hmun Gehena-a paih nih ai chuan, mit khing dela Pathian rama luh chu i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mi tin meia tih thianghlim an ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chi hi a ṭha e; nimahsela, chi pawh hi da ta se, engin nge in tihal leh ang? Nangmahni ngeiah chi nei ula; tichuan, inngeih dial dial rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, chuta ṭang chuan Judai ramah leh Jordan râlah te a kal a, mipuiin an lo bawh ruih ruih a; tichuan, a tih dân pângngaiin a lo zirtîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farisai-te a hnênah an lo kal a, amah fiah nan, “Miin a nupui a mâk a thiang em?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mosian engtin nge thu a pêk che u?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Mosian inmâkna lehkha ziakin inmâk a phal,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “In thinlung khauh avângin asin chu thupêk chu in tân a ziak ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, thilsiam ṭân tirh aṭang rêngin mipa leh hmeichhia a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan mipain a nu leh pa a thlah ang a, a nupui a vuan ang; tichuan, an pahnih chuan tisa pumkhat an lo ni tawh ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />pahnih an ni tawh lo va, pumkhat an lo ni tawh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin a zawm tawh avângin mipain ṭhen suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inah a zirtîrten chûng thu chu an zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tu pawhin a nupui a ṭhena, mi dang a neih chuan a nupui chu a uiresan a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />hmeichhia pawhin a pasal a ṭhena, mi dang a neih chuan a pasal a uiresan a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a deh atân a hnênah naupangte an rawn hruai a, zirtîrte erawh chuan an lo hnar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan a hmuhin a lungni lo êm êm a, an hnênah, “Naupangte ka hnênah han kaltîr ula, hnar suh u, Pathian ram chu hêng ang mite ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Pathian ram chu naupang anga lâwm lo apiang; tu mah a chhûngah an lût tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anni chu a lo kuah a, an chungah kut nghatin mal a sâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isua chu zin tûra a chhuah laiin mi pakhat a lo tlân a, a hmaah a ṭhingṭhi a, “Zirtîrtu Ṭha, chatuan nun ka chan theih nân eng nge ka tih tûr?” tiin a rawn zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Engati nge Ṭha mi tih? Tu mah ṭha an awm lo, Pathian chauh lo chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thupêkte chu i hria alâwm, ‘Tual that suh, uire suh, ru suh, dâwtin hêk suh, bum suh, i nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,’ tihte hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Zirtîrtu, chûng zawng zawng chu ka tleirâwl tirh ata ka zâwm ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan ani chu a han en chiang a, a ngaina ta hle a, a hnênah, “Kawng khat i la bâk e; kal la, i neih apiang va hralh la, pachhiate pe rawh; chutichuan, vânah ro i nei dâwn nia; tin, lo kal la, mi zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng thu avâng chuan a ngui ta hle a, lungngai takin a kal ta a, sum ngah tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isua chu a han hawi vêl a, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Sum ngahte tân Pathian rama luh a va harsa dâwn êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan a thu sawi chu mak an ti êm êm a; Isua chuan anni chu a chhâng leh a, “Naute u, Pathian rama luh hi a harsa teh asin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian rama mi hausa an luh aiin hriau benga sanghâwngsei kal tlang a awl zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mak an ti lutuk a, “Chuti chu tu nge chhandam ni thei ang le?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a en a, “Pathian tân tih loh, mihring tân chuan tih rual a ni lo rêng a; Pathian tân erawh chuan engkim tih theih a ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “Ngai teh, keini lahin engkim kalsanin kan zui ta si che a,” a ti hman chauh va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan a lo chhâng a, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh keimah avâng leh Chanchin Ṭha avânga in emaw, unaute emaw, farnute emaw, nu emaw, pa emaw, fate emaw, ramte emaw kalsan chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tûn dam chhûng la la hian in te, unau te, farnu te, nu leh pa te, fa te a lêt za an hmu ngei ang, tihduhdahna te leh hun lo thleng tûra chatuan nun nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi tam tak hmasa bera awmte chu hnuhnûng ber an la ni ang a, hnuhnûng bera awmte pawh hmasa ber an la ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-a chho tûrin kawngah chuan an kal a, Isuan hma a hruai a, anni chuan mak an ti hle a, a zuitute pawh chu an zâm hle a. Isuan Sâwmpahnihte chu a hruai hrang leh a, a chunga thil lo thleng tûr zawng zawng chu a hrilh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, Jerusalem-ah kan chhoh dâwn hi. Mihring Fapa hi puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute hnênah mantîr a ni dâwn; anni chuan thi tûrin a chungah thu an titlu ang a, Jentail-te hnênah an hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anni chuan an lo nuihzat ang a, chil an chhâk ang a, an vua ang a, an tihlum ang; mahse, ni thum chinah a tho leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh Johana chuan ani chu an rawn hnaih a, “Zirtîrtu, kan dîl tûr apiang che min tihsak kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng nge tihsak che u ila in duh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Anni chuan, “I ropuinaah chuan i ding lamah pakhat, i vei lamah pakhat min ṭhuttîr ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “In thil dîl hi in hre lo va ni. Ka no in tûr chu in in thei dâwn em ni? Baptisma ka chan tûr pawh in chang thei dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Anni pawh chuan, “Thei ang,” an ti a. Isuan, “Ka no in tûr chu in in ang a, baptisma ka chan tûr pawh chu in chang ve ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />nimahsela, ka ding lam emaw, vei lam emawa ṭhuttîr chu ka thu a ni lo va, an buatsaihsakte tân a ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Zirtîr dang sâwmte chuan chu chu an lo hriatin Jakoba leh Johana chungah chuan an lungni lo ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan anniho chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Jentail-te chunga rorêltua ruatte chu an chungah an intilal êm êm ṭhîn a, an mi liante pawhin an chungah thu an nei êm êm ṭhîn tih in hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zîngah zawng chutiang tûr a ni lo ve, tu pawh in zînga ropui ber nih duh chu in rawngbâwltuah a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tu pawh in zînga hmasa ber nih duh pawh chu, mi zawng zawng chhiahhlawhah a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mihring Fapa meuh pawh rawngbâwlsaka awm tûrin a lo kal lo va, rawngbâwl tûr leh mi tam tak tlan nân a nun pe tûrin a lo kal zâwk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jeriko khua an lo thleng a, a zirtîrte leh mipui nasa tak nên Jeriko aṭang chuan an chhuak a; Timaia fapa, kutdawh, mitdel, Bartimaia chu, kawng sîrah a lo ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nazaret Isua a ni tih a hriat chuan, “Isu, Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au ta vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mi tam takin an hau va, ngawi tûra an tih pawhin, a hma aia ringin, “Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au zual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Isua chu a ding a, “Han ko teh u,” a ti a. Mitdel chu an ko va, “Ngaihṭha takin awm la, tho rawh, a ko va che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ani chuan a puan a paih lawk a, a zuang tho va, Isua hnên lam chu a pan ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Isuan a lo bia a, “Eng nge tihsak che ila i duh?” a ti a. Mitdel chuan, “Raboni, hmuh theih ka duh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan, “Kal rawh le, i rinna i dam phah a ni e,” a ti a. Khua a lo hmu thei ta nghâl mai a, kalkawngah chuan a zui ve ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem an lo hnaih ta a, Oliv tlânga Bethfage khua leh Bethani khua an thlen dâwn chuan a zirtîrte zînga pahnih a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“In hma zâwn khuaah sâwn va kal ta ula, khua in luh veleh, tu ma la chuanna ngai loh, sabengtung no thlun in va hmu mai ang; phelh ula han kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin, ‘Engati nge khatia in tih mai?’ an tih che u chuan, ‘Lalpan a mamawh a ni, a rawn dahtîr leh thuai ang,’ ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An kal ta a, sabengtung no, kawngka bula thlun, pâwn lam kawtthlêra ding chu an va hmu a, an phelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuta ding tute emaw chuan an lo hmu a, “Engtizia nge sabengtung kha in phelh tâk mai?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni erawh chuan Isua hrilh ang tak khân an sawi a; tichuan, an kal an phal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sabengtung no chu Isua hnênah an rawn kai a, a chungah an puante an phah a, Isua chu a chuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tam takin kalkawngah an puante an phah a, a ṭhenin rama mi chhâwl sâtin an phah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmaa kalte leh a hnunga zuitute chu “Hosana! Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram lo thleng tûr, kan pa Davida ram chu Chawimawiin awm rawh se, Chungnung berah khian Hosana,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-a Tempulah chuan a va lût a, engkim a en vêl zawh chuan khua pawh a tlai lam ta a, Sâwmpahnihte nên Bethani lamah an kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Bethani aṭanga an chhuak chu a ril a lo ṭâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hla takah, theipui hnah nei hluah hi a hmu a, a rah a awm mial law maw tiin a va pan a, a va thlen chuan a hnah chauh lo chu eng mah a hmu lo va, theipui rah hun a ni lo rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan thing hnênah chuan, “Tûn a chinah chuan, kumkhuain i rah tu man ei tawh suh se,” a ti a. A zirtîrte pawh chuan chu chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem chu an lo thleng a, Tempulah chuan a lût a, chuta englo zuartute leh leitute chu a hnawt chhuak ta a, tangka thlengtute dawhkânte leh ṭhuro zuartute ṭhutthlêngte chu a nam thlûksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tempulah chuan tu man bungrua an kal tlangpui pawh a phal lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “ ‘Ka in chu hnam tin tân ṭawngṭaina in an ti ang,’ tih ziak a ni lâwm ni? Nangni erawh chuan suamhmangte pûkah in siam ta zâwk a nih hi,” tiin a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan an lo hria a, amah tihhlum dân tûr an zawng ta a, a zirtîrna chu mipui zawng zawngin an ngaihsân êm avângin ani chu an hlau hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tlaiah chuan khawpui ata chu a kal chhuak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zîngah an kal pahin theipui kûng kha a zung nên lam a thi ta tih an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Petera chuan a hre chhuak a, a hnênah, “Rabi, en teh, theipui ânchhia i lawh kha a lo thi dêr mai!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Pathian ring rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, tu pawhin he tlâng hnênah hian, ‘Insawn la, tuifinriatah inpaih rawh,’ ti ang sela, a thinlunga ringhlel hauh lova, a sawi ang chuan a lo thleng ngei ang tih a rin tlat chuan tihsak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka hrilh a che u, in ṭawngṭaia in thil dîl apiang hmu tawhah inngai ula, tihsak in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ṭawngṭai tûra in din hun pawhin mi chunga thu pawi eng emaw in neih chuan ngaidam rawh u; in Pa vâna mi pawhin in bawhchhiatnate a ngaihdam ve theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem chu an thleng leh a; Tempul a fan vêl laiin puithiam lalte, Dân zirtîrtute leh upahote a hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Eng thuneihnain nge hêng thil hi i tih? Tu nge thu pe che?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan, “Thu kam khat ka han zâwt ang che u; mi chhâng ula, kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Johana baptisma kha, vâna mi thu nge mihring thu? Mi chhang rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An inrâwn tlâng a, “Vâna mi thu kan tih chuan, ‘Engah nge a thu in awih loh?’ min ti dâwn si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘mihring thu’ kan ti mai emaw chu ni ang?” an inti a. Mahse, mi zawng zawngin Johana chu zâwlnei ni ngeiah an pawm tlat avângin mipui chu an hlau bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu an chhâng a, “Kan hre lo,” an ti a. Isua pawh chuan, “Kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh bîk lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tehkhin thuin an hnênah thu a sawi ta a. “Tu-in emaw grep huan a siam a, palin a hung a, grep sâwr khur a siam a, vênbûk sâng tak a sa bawk a, thlawh hlawh tûrin huan enkawltute a pe a, ram dangah a kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lawh hun chuan a chan ai la tûrin huan enkawltute hnênah chuan bawih pakhat a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anni chuan an lo man a, an vêl a, kut ruakin an hawtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawih dang an hnênah a tîr leh a, ani pawh chu a lu an vuak pawhsak a, zahthlâk takin an sawisa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawih dang a tîr leh a, chu phei chu an lo that a. Bawih dangte pawh a tîr zêl a, a ṭhen an lo vêl a, a ṭhen an lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi dang tirh âwm pakhat, a fapa duh tak chauh a nei tawh a, ‘Ka fapa hi chu an lo zah ang chu maw,’ tiin a hnuhnûng berah a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, huan enkawltute chuan, ‘He mi hi ro luahtu tûr chu a ni, hawh u, i that ang u, a ro luah tûr hi kan ta a ni mai ang,’ an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu an man a, an that a, grep huan ata chu an paih chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan neitupa chuan engtin nge a rawn tih ang? A lo kal ang a, huan enkawltute chu a rawn tiboral ang a, huan chu mi dang a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He Lehkha Thu hi in chhiar lâwm ni? ‘In satute lung duh loh kha Chu ngei chu a kil lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpa tih a ni a, Kan hmuhin mak kan ti,’ tih kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu tehkhin thu chu anmahni demin a sawi tih an hriatin man an tum a; amaherawhchu, mipui an hlau bawk si a, ani chu an kalsan a, an kal bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thu sawiah a inṭawngâwk thei dah law maw tiin a hnênah Farisai-te leh Heroda pâwla mi ṭhenkhat an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnên an lo thlen chuan, “Zirtîrtu, mi dik tak i ni a, pawisak chuan tu mah i nei lo tih kan hria e, tu mah zah bîk pawh nei chuang lovin Pathian thu dik tak i zirtîr ṭhîn; Kaisara hnêna chhiah chawi tûr kan ni nge ni lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan pe ang nge pe lo vang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an vervêkzia chu a lo hmuhin “Engah nge ṭawngawhtîr min tum? Duli mi han lâk ula, ka lo en teh ang,” a ti a. Anni chuan an rawn la a, an hnênah, “Hei, tu lem leh tu hming nge chuang hi?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Kaisara,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isua chuan, “Kaisara ta chu Kaisara pe ula, Pathian ta chu Pathian pe ta che u,” tiin a chhâng a. Mak an ti nasa êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sadukai-ho, thawhlehna a awm lo titute pawh chu a hnênah an lo kal ve a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Zirtîrtu, Mosian, ‘Tu pawhin fa nei lovin nupui thihsan se, a nupui chu a unaupain rochungin a unaupa tân chuan chi a thlahsak tûr a ni,’ tiin min ziaksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw le, unau mipa pasarih an awm a, a upa ber chuan nupui a nei a; mahse, fa nei lovin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A dawttu chuan a nupui chu a rochung a, chi thlah lovin a thi ve leh ta a; a pathumna pawh chutiang chu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unau pasarihte chuan nupuiah an nei ṭheuh va; mahse, tu man chi rêng an thlah lo. A tâwpah hmeichhia pawh chu a thi ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thawhlehnaah chuan tu nupui ber nge ni ang, an pasarihin nupuiah an nei ṭheuh si a?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Lehkha Thu leh Pathian thiltihtheihna in hriat loh avâng hian a ni rêng lâwm ni in kal sual ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An lo thawhleh hun chuan nupui pasal an innei tawh dâwn hlei nêm, vâna vântirhkohte ang mai an ni zâwk dâwn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mitthite kaihthawha an awm tûr thu-ah chuan - Mosia lehkhabua hnimbuka meialh thu kha in chhiar ngai lo vem ni? Pathianin a hnênah, ‘Kei hi Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian ka ni,’ a tih kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chu mitthi Pathian a ni lo va, mi nung Pathian a ni zâwk; in bo nasa tawh a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtu zînga pakhat a lo kal a, an thu sawite chu a ngaithla a, a chhâng ṭha hle tih a hriat chuan a hnênah, “Thupêk zawng zawngah a eng hi nge pawimawh ber?” tiin a han zâwt ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhang a, “Aw Israel, ngai teh, Lalpa kan Pathian chauh hi Lalpa chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian chu i thinlung zawng zawngin, i nunna zawng zawngin, i rilru zawng zawngin, i chakna zawng zawngin i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi a pawimawh ber a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a dawttu chu, ‘Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte pawh hmangaih ve rawh,’ tih hi a ni. Hêng aia thupêk pawimawh zâwk rêng hi a awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtu pawh chuan, “A ni tak e, Zirtîrtu, Lalpa chauh hi Pathian chu a ni a, amah chauh lo chu tu mah dang an awm lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amah chauh chu ngaihtuahna zawng zawng leh hriatna zawng zawng leh chakna zawng zawnga hmangaih leh mahni inhmangaih anga vêngte hmangaih hi pumhâl thilhlan leh inthawina zawng zawng aiin a ṭha zâwk êm êm tih hi, i sawi dik ngei mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ngun taka ngaihtuahin a chhâng a ni tih Isuan a hriatin, “Pathian ram chu i hlat lo ve,” a ti a. Chuta chin chu tu man eng mah an zâwt ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isuan Tempula a zirtîr pah chuan a sawi zêl a, “Dân zirtîrtute hian engtizia nge Krista chu Davida fapa nia an sawi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amah Davida ngei khân Thlarau Thianghlima sawiin, ‘Lalpa chuan ka Lalpa hnênah, Ka ding lamah lo ṭhu rawh, I hmêlmate i ke hnuaiah ka han dah ang e,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amah Davida ngeiin ani chu ‘Lalpa,’ a tih si chuan engtin nge a fapa a nih theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mipui pung khâwm nasa tak chuan a thu chu an ngaithla tui hle a. A zirtîr pah chuan an hnênah, “Dân zirtîrtu, kawrfual haa lên vêl chînga, dâwr hmuna chibai bûk ngainaa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />sunagog-a ṭhutna langsâr ber leh ruai ṭhehna hmuna ṭhutna pawimawh ber ngiat ṭhînte lakah hian fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hêngho, hmeithai sum ei zawhsaka, mi hmuh atân maia rei tak tak ṭawngṭai chîng site hian hrem an tuar nasa ber ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, thawhlâwm bâwm zâwnah chuan a ṭhu a, miten bâwma tangka an thlâk lai chu a lo thlîr reng a. Mi hausa tak takte chuan an rawn thlâk ṭeuh ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hmeithai rethei tak pakhat hi a lo kal ve a, dar pawisa pahnih a rawn thlâk a (chu chu pawisa pakhat hu a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Isuan a zirtîrte chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, mi dang zawng zawng aiin he hmeithai rethei tak hian thawhlâwm bâwmah a thlâk tam zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mi dangte hi chuan an neih liam an rawn thlâk a; ani hi chuan tlachham chung chungin, a neih zawng zawng, intunnunna tûra a neih chhun chu, a rawn thlâk a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tempul ata chu an kal chhuah laiin a zirtîrte zînga pakhat chuan, “Zirtîrtu, en teh, a lungte hi a lianin, a in sakte hi a mawi teh a nia!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Hêng in lian pui pui hi i hmu maw? Lung intiang rêng rêng pakhat mah tihchim lohva hnutchhiah a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tempul zâwn, Oliv Tlânga a ṭhut laiin Petera te, Jakoba te, Johana te, Andria te chuan a fâlin thu an zâwt a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Chûng chu engtikah nge a lo awm ang a, chûng zawng zawng lo thlen dâwn chuan chhinchhiahna thil mak eng eng nge lo awm ang? Min hrilh teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan a hrilh ta a; “Tu man an hruai bo loh nân che u fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hming chhâlin, ‘Keimah hi ka ni,’ tiin mi tam tak an lo chhuak ang a, mi an hruai bo ṭeuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Indo ri te, indo chanchinte in hriat hunah pawh thlaphâng suh ang che u, chûng chu lo thleng tûr rêng a ni; hun tawp erawh zawng a ni rih lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam hrang leh hnam hrang an indo vang a, sawrkâr leh sawrkâr an indo vang, hmun hrang hrangah lîr a nghîng ang a, ṭâm a la tla ang. Chûng chu nau vei a inṭan ta tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nangni zawng inring rawh u; Sunagog-ahte leh a rorêltute hnênah an hlân ang che ua, an vua ang che u, keimah avângin hotute leh lalte hmaah, ka thu an hriat theih nân, an dintîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha hi hnam zawng zawng hnênah hril hmasak ngei tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An man che u a, in chungthu rêl tûra an hlan hun che u chuan in sawi tûr enghelh lâwk suh ang che u, chumi huna lo lang apiang chu in sawi mai dâwn nia, a sawitu chu nangni in ni dâwn si lo, Thlarau Thianghlim a ni zâwk dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tihhlum tûrin unau leh unau an inmantîr ang a, pa pawhin a fa; fate pawhin an nu leh pate an do vang a, an tihhlumtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima hming avângin mi tam takin an hua ang che u a; nimahsela, a tâwp thlenga chhel taka tuar peih apiang, chûng mite ngei chu chhandam an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tiṭiautu tenawm chu a din lohna tûra ding in hmuh hunah erawh chuan (a chhiar chuan a awmzia hre rawh se), Judai rama awmte chu tlângramahte tlân rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In chunga awm chu ina lûtin a chhûnga englo chuh tûrin chhuk suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />lova feh pawh a silhfên chuh tûrin haw hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng huna naupaite leh nauno pawmte chu an va khawngaihthlâk dâwn em!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlasik khaw chên laia a lo thlen loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi huna hrehawm lo thleng chu, Pathianin leilung a siam tirh ata la awm ngai lo, engtik maha awm leh tawh hek lo tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpan chûng nite chu titawi lo se mihring tu mah an dam khawchhuak lo vang; a mi thlante avângin a titawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chutih hunah chuan, tu pawhin in hnênah, ‘En teh u, Krista chu heta hi,’ emaw, ‘En teh u, sawta saw,’ emaw an tih pawhin awih suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Krista der leh zâwlnei derte an lo chhuak dâwn si a, thei ang sela thlante meuh pawh hruai bo tûrin chhinchhiahna leh thil makte an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangni zawng fîmkhur rawh u, engkim ka hrilh diam tawh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Chûng hun hrehawm chu a liam hun chuan ni a thim ang a, thla a êng hek lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />vân aṭangin arsite a tla ang a, vâna thiltihtheihnate chu tihnghîn a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Mihring Fapa hi thiltihtheihna nasa tak nên ropui takin chhûm zînga lo kal an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, vântirhkohte chu a tîr chhuak ang a, a mi thlante chu kâwlkil li ata leilung tâwp aṭanga vân tâwp thlengin a lâwr khâwmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tichuan, theipui kûng awm dân aṭang hian zir tûr in nei; a zîk a lo nova, hnah a rawn chhuah chuan nipui a thaw dâwn tih in hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin, nangni pawhin chûng zawng zawng lo thleng in hmuh hun chuan ani chu a lo hnai tawh a, a lo thleng ṭêp tawh tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, chûng zawng zawng chu a lo thlen hma chuan tûnlai mite hi an ral hman lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lei leh vân a ral ang a, ka thu erawh chu a ral tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Nimahsela, chûng thil lo thlen hun tûr, ni leh dâr chu; Pa chauh lo chuan tu man an hre lo, vâna vântirhkohte pawhin, Fapa pawhin an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Fîmkhur ula, inring reng rawh u, chumi hun chu in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi ram danga zin dâwna, a bawihte hnêna an hna pual ṭheuhva mawhphurhtîra, kawngkhâr vêngtu pawh inring renga awm tûra hrilh diama kal ta daih ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvângin, inring reng rawh u. In neitupa hâwn hun tûr chu tlai lamah nge, zânlaiah nge, âr khuanah nge, kâwl ênah nge tih in hre si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a lo haw thut mai zawngin muhîlin a rawn hmu hlauh dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, in hnêna sawi hi mi zawng zawng tâna sawi ka ni, inring reng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni hnih hnuah Kalhlên Kût leh Chhang Dawidim telh loh Kût a awm dâwn a; puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan amah chu ngamthlêma mana tihhlum theihna kawng an zawng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kût lai chuan ni suh se, mipui zîngah buaina a chhuak dah ang e,” an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bethani-ah, phâr Simona ina chaw a kîl laiin alabasta bûra nard hriak rimtui hlîr hlak, to tak kengin hmeichhe pakhat a lo kal a, alabasta bur chu a tikeh a, a lu-ah a leih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuta mi ṭhenkhat chu an lungni lo hle a, anmahni zîngah, “Engati nge hriak rimtui hi a tihriral tâk mai chu le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Duli zathum aia tam man a ni si a; hralha, mi retheite pêk zâwk âwm,” tiin chu nu chu an sawisêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Eng mah tih suh u, engah nge in tihbuai? Ka chunga a tih hi thil ṭha ti a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In zîngah mi retheite eng lai pawhin an awm a, in duh hun hunah thil ṭha in tihsak thei a; kei erawh chu in zînga awm reng tûr ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tih theih ang chu a ti ta a, ka taksa hi phûm tûrin hriak a lo hnawih lâwk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, khawvêl pum puia chanchin Ṭha hi an hrilhna apiangah, he nu thil tih pawh hi amah hriat reng nân an sawi ve zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Sâwmpahnihte zînga mi pakhat, Juda Iskariota kha Isua mantîr tumin puithiam lalte hnênah a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu an lo hriatin an lâwm hle a, pawisa pêk an tiam ta a. Tichuan, mantîr dân tûr remchâng a zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhang Dawidim telh loh Kût ni hmasa ber, Kalhlên Kût berâmno an talh ṭhinna ni-ah chuan, a zirtîrten, “Khawi hmunah nge Kalhlên kût chaw i ei tûr va buatsaih i la i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrte zînga mi pahnih a tîr a, “Khawpuiah va kal ta ula, pa pakhat hlumbêla tui chawiin a lo tâwk ang che u; ani chu zui ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a luhna in neitu hnênah chuan, ‘Zirtîrtu chuan, Ka zirtîrte nêna Kalhlên Kût chaw kan eina tûr pindan chu khawiah nge? a ti e,’ va ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah ngei chuan pindan chungnung zau tak, engkim awm, peih diam a entîr ang che u, chutah chuan kan tân va buatsaih tawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrte chu an chhuak a, khawpuiah chuan an va kal a, an hnêna a sawi ang ngei khân an va hmu a, Kalhlên Kût chaw chu an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khua a lo tlai lam chuan Sâwmpahnihte nên an va kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chaw an kîl a, an ei lai chuan Isuan, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, in zînga pakhat, mi kîlpuitu ngei hian, mi mantîr dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An mangang ta hle a, a mal malin a hnênah, “Kei chu ka ni lâwng chu maw?” an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Sâwmpahnihte zînga mi, thlêng mi zenpuitu ngei hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring Fapa mantîrtu tûr mihring chung chu a pik e. Chu mihring chu piang lo se a tân a ṭha zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutia an ei lai chuan Isuan chhang a la a, malsâwmna a sawi a, a phel a, an hnênah a pe a, “La rawh u, hei hi ka taksa a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />No pawh chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin an hnênah a pe a, nova mi chu an za chuan an in ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hei hi ka thisen, thuthlunna, mi tam tak tâna chhuak tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Pathian rama a thar ka in hun a thlen hma zawng, grep rah tui hi ka in leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hla an sak zawh chuan Oliv tlâng panin an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “In za-in mi hawisan vek ang. ‘Berâmpu chu ka vua ang a, berâmte chu an darh ang,’ tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, kaihthawha ka awm hnuin Galili ramah ka lo kal hmasa ang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Petera erawh chuan, “An vaiin hawisan vek che mah se kei zawngin ka hawisan hauh lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che, zâninah, zânin la la hian, âr vawi hnih a khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan khauh takin, “I thihnaah chuan thi ve dâwn pawh ni ila, ka phat tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Chutiang bawkin an za chuan an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan pakhat, Gethsemani an tih chu, an thleng a, a zirtîrte hnênah, “Ka ṭawngṭai hlânin hetah hian lo ṭhu rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Petera te, Jakoba te, Johana te chu a hruai a. Nasa takin a thlaphâng a, a mangang ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An hnênah, “Ka thla a phâng hle mai a! Thihpui tham hial a ni; hetah hian awm ula, lo inrâlring rawh u” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hma lamah tlêm a va kal hlek a, leiah a bawkkhup a, chumi hun chuan amah a pelh mial theih nân a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Abba, ka pa, engkim i ti thei a, he no hi mi lâk sawnsak rawh; nimahsela, keima thu ni lovin nangma thu thu ni zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A lo kîr a, anniho muthlu chu a rawn hmu a; Petera hnênah “Simon, i muthlu a ni maw? Dârkâr khat chauh pawh i inrâlring thei na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thlêmnaa in tlûk luh loh nân invêngin ṭawngṭai rawh u; thlarau zawngin a huam a, tisa erawh chu a chak lo va ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A kal leh a, a thu sawi ngai sawiin a va ṭawngṭai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A lo kîr leh chuan an muthlu chu a rawn hmu leh a, an mut a chhuah êm avângin chhân ngaihna pawh an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A lo kîr vawi thumnaah chuan, “In la muthluin in la inthlahdul ta cheu a ni maw? A tâwk ta e, a hun chu a lo thleng ta; ngai teh u, Mihring Fapa hi mi sualte kûtah hlan a nih dâwn tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tho teh u, i kal ang u. En teh u, mi mantîrtu tûr pawh a lo hnaih tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chutia a la ṭawng lai mêk chuan Juda, Sâwmpahnihte zînga pakhat kha a lo thleng ta nghâl a, ama rual chuan puithiam lalte, Dân zirtîrtute leh upate tirh mi tam tak, khandaih leh talhtum kengin an lo thleng ta rup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A mantîrtu tûr khân chhinchhiahna tûr a lo hrilh lâwk tawh diam a, “Ka fawha chu amah chu a ni ang, man ula, ngun taka vêngin hruai ang che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A lo thlen veleh Isua chu a rawn pan nghâl, a, “Rabi,” tiin a fâwp ta ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Isua chu an chelh a, an man ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A kianga dingte zînga pakhat chuan khandaih a phawi a, puithiam lalber bawih chu a sât a, a beng a hlawisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chûngho chu Isuan a bia a, an hnênah, “Suamhmang man tûr ang ziazângin khandaih leh talhtum kengin min man tûrin in lo thawk a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />In zîngah tempulah ni tin mi ka zirtîr ṭhîn a, mi man si lo. Lehkha Thu chu lo thlêng tûr rêng a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan amah chu an hawisan a, an tlânchhiatsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tlangvâl pakhat, puan zai sîn chauh sin hian a lo zui ve a, ani pawh chu an man a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />mahse, a tâl pût a, saruakin a tlân bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Isua chu Puithiam lalber hnênah an hruai a, puithiam lal te, upaho te leh Dân zirtîrtu te an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Petera pawh chuan hnung fêah Puithiam lalber in hual chhûng kawtlai thlengin a rawn zui a; chhiahhlawhte zîngah chuan meilum aiin a ṭhu ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Puithiam lalber leh Sanhedrin-a tel zawng zawng chuan Isua tihhlum theihna tûr thu an zawng ta a; mahse, an hmu hlei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mi tam takin dâwtin an rawn hêk a; nimahsela, an hêkna thu chu a inhmu thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat an lo ding chhuak a, dâwtin an hêk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“‘He Tempul, kuta sak hi ka ṭhiat ang a, a dang, kuta sak ni lo, ni thum chhûngin ka din leh ang,’ a tih keimahni ngei hian kan hria,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Chu thilah pawh chuan an hêkna thu chu a inhmu thei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Puithiam lalber chu a laiah a va ding chhuak a, Isua chu a zâwt a, “Hêngho hêkna che hi i chhâng thei na nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a ngawi reng a, a enga mah a chhâng lo. Puithiam lalber chuan a hnênah, “Faktlâka Fapa, Krista chu i ni em?” tiin a zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan a chhâng ta a, “Ka ni asin, Mihring Fapa hi Thiltitheia ding lama ṭhu-a, vân chhûmte nên a lo kal in la hmu dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Chu veleh Puithiam lalber chuan a silhfênte chu a pawtthlêr a, “Thuhretu dang engah nge kan ngaih tawh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Pathian pawi a sawi dân chu in hre ta, engtin nge in ngaih?” a ti a. Tichuan, an za-in Isua chu tihhlum tlâkah an ngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />A ṭhen phei chuan amah chu chil an chhak ta pang a, a hmai te an tuam a, an hnek a, ‘Tu nge ti che sawi teh, an ti a. Vêngtute chuan an kai a, an bêng sawk sawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Petera chu in chhâwng hnuai lam in hung chhûng kawt laiah chuan a awm reng a. Puithiam lalber chhiahhlawh zînga nula pakhat a lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Petera meilum ai chu a rawn hmu a, a han en chiang a, “Nang pawh hi he Nazaret mi Isua hnêna awm kha i nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “I thu sawi awmzia chu ka hre hauh lo mai, a ngaihna pawh ka hre lo ve,” tiin a phat a. Pâwn lam a pan a (ar a khuang a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nula khân a enzui a, a bula dingte hnênah chuan, “An zînga mi a ni maw le,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ani chuan a phat leh a. Chumi hnu lawkah Petera kianga dingte chuan, “An zînga mi i nih ngei hi, Galili mi i ni alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan ânchhe dawn huamin chhia a chham a, “Chu mihring in sawia chu ka hre hauh lo,” a ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />âr chu a khuang leh ta nghâl a. Isuan a hnêna, “âr vawi hnih a khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ang,” a tih thu kha Petera chuan a hre chhuak a; lungchhe takin a ṭap chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zîng a lo nih veleh puithiam lalte chu upate, Dân zirtîrtute leh Sanhedrin pum pui chuan ro an rêl a; Isua chu an hlîng a, an kai a, Pilata kutah an hlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pilata chuan ani chu a lo zâwt a, “Juda-te lal i ni maw?” a ti a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Chu, i sawi chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puithiam lalte chuan an hêk mawlh mawlh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan a zâwt leh a, “An hêkna zozai che hi i hre na nge, a enga mah i chhân loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a enga mah chu a chhâng ta chuang lo va, Pilata chuan mak a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kût niin mi tâng pakhat an ngen apiang Pilatan a chhuahsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Helho tâng zînga pakhat, Baraba an tih chu, hel laia tual an thahnaa a tel ve avângin tân inah a tâng reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipuite chu an han chho va, a tih ṭhin ang kha tihsak leh tûrin Pilata chu an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Juda-te lal hi chhuahsak che u ila in duh em?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiam lalte chuan îtsîkna avângin a kutah an rawn hlân a ni tih a hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiam lalte chuan mipui chu Baraba chhuahsak dîl tûrin an fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan anniho chu, “Chuti chu Juda-te lal in tiha hi engtia ka tih nge in duh?” tiin a zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anniho chu an au leh a, “Krawsah khêngbet rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pilata chuan, “Engah maw? Eng nge a tihsual?” a ti a. Nimahsela, anniho chu ring lehzualin, “Krawsah khêngbet rawh,” tiin an au ta tuar tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan mipui tihlungawi a duh a, Baraba chu a chhuahsak ta a; Isua erawh chu sipaite a vuaktîr a, krawsa khenbeh tûrin an hnênah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sipaite chuan in hual chhûngah, praitorian an tihah chuan an hruai lût a, an pâwla mi zawng zawng an au khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chu kawrfual senduk an hâktîr a, chawimawina atân hlîng an kual a, an khumtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Chibai, Juda-te lal!” tiin chibai an bûk ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tiangin a lu-ah an vua a, chil an chhâk a, ṭhingṭhiin chibai an bûk el huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutia nuihza siam nâna an hman zawh chuan kawrfual senduk chu an hlihsak a, ama kawr an hâktîr leh a, krawsa khenbeh tûrin an hruai chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thingtlâng lam aṭanga lo kal mi pakhat, Simona, Kurini khaw mi, Aleksandara leh Rufa pa, lo ding chu Isua kraws putsak tûrin an man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Golgotha, ‘Luruh hmun’ an tih thleng chuan an hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mura pawlh uain an pe a; mahse, a duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, krawsah an khêngbet ta a. An chan ṭheuh tûr hriat theih nân ṭhumvâwrin a silhfênte chu an insem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An khenbeh hun chu zîng dâr kua vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah an hêkna thu ziak an târ a, ‘Juda-te lal,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama rual chuan suamhmang pahnih an khêngbet bawk a, a ding lamah pakhat, a vei lamah pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi vei nuk nukte chuan an lu thingin, “Uai! Nang, Tempul ṭhiata ni thuma din leh theitu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />intidam la, kraws ata kha lo chhuk ta che,” tiin an tiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan, “Mi dang mah tidam ṭhîn, mahni lah intidam thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah kan rin theih nân kan hmuhah, Krista, Israel lal chu, tûnah hian kraws ata lo chhuk ang hmiang!” tiin hmusit takin an tiel bawk a. Ama ruala khenbehte pawh chuan chutiang bawkin an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chhûn dâr sâwm leh pahnih a lo ni a, tlai dar thum thlengin khawvêl pum pui a thim ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tlai dâr thumah chuan Isua chu ring takin a au va, “Eloi, Eloi, Lema Sabakthani,” tiin (chu chu, “Ka Pathian, Ka Pathian, engah nge mi kalsan?” tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A kianga ding ṭhenkhatte chuan chu chu an hriatin, “Ngai teh u, Elija a ko va ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi pakhat a tlân a, uain thûrah sponj a chiah a, tiangah a târ a, Isua chu intîr a tum a, “Ngawi rú, amah la thla tûrin Elija a lo kal emaw i en ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Isua chu aw ring takin a au va, a hnuk a chat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Tempul chhûng puanzâr chu a chung lam aṭangin a hnuai lam thlengin a thlêr thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A hma zâwna sipai za hotu ding pawh chuan chutia a hnuk chat ta chu a hmuh chuan, “He mi hi Pathian Fapa a lo nih ngei hi le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hmeichheho pawhin hla tak aṭangin an thlîr ve reng a, chûng zîngah chuan Magdala khaw mi Mari te, Jakob naupang zâwka nu Mari te, Josea nu te, Salomi te an tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hêng mite hi Galili rama a awm laia amah zuia a rawngbâwlsak ṭhîntute an ni; tin, a ruala Jerusalem-a chho ve hmeichhe dang pawh tam tak an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Juda-te Inrinni a ni a, (chu chu Sabat ni atâna an inbuatsaih ni a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Josefa, Arimathai khuaa mi, rorêltu zînga tel, mi zahawm tak, Pathian ram beisei mi ve bawk kha, tlai lam a lo nih chuan a lo kal ve a, huai takin Pilata a va luh chilh a, Isua ruang chu a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pilata chuan a thi ta mai tih a hriat chuan mak a ti hle a, sipai za hotu chu a ko va, a thihna chin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sipai za hotu ka aṭanga a hriat hnu chuan a ruang chu Josefa a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tichuan, puan zai sîn a lei a, amah chu a la thla a, puan zai sîn chuan a tuam a, lung ker thlânah a zalh a, thlân kawngka chu lungin a khâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Magdala mi Mari leh Josea nu Mari pawh chuan an zalhna chu an en reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabat ni a lo ral a, Magdala mi Mari te, Jakoba nu Mari te, Salomi te chuan a ruang va hnawih atân hriak rimtui an lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathianni zîngah thlânah an va kal a, ni pawh a chhuak tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thlân kawngka ata lung chu tuin nge min lum sawnsak ang,” an intih lai mêkin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(lung lian tak a ni rêng a) an han dâk a, lung chu lum sawn sa-in an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlânah chuan an lût a, tlangvâl pakhat puan vâr sin, ding lam panga ṭhu an hmu a, an bîng ta chûk chûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hlau suh u, Nazaret Isua, an khenbeh kha, in zawng a ni âwm a, kaihthawh a ni tawh a, hetah a awm tawh lo; en teh u, an zalhna chu hei hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, kal ula, a zirtîrte leh Petera hnênah chuan, ‘A hrilh che u ang ngei khân Galili-ah a lo kal hmasa dâwn a, chutah chuan in hmu ang,’ tiin va hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An khûr a, an thauvah a man tâk avâng chuan thlân ata chu an chhuak a, an tlânchhe ta a; tu ma hnênah eng mah an sawi lo, an hlau êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Tin, Pathianni zînga a thawhleh khân Magdala mi Mari, a kawchhûng ata ramhuai pasarih a hnawh chhuahsak hnênah khân a inlâr hmasa ber a. (Tichuan, an hnêna a thu hrilh zawng zawng chu hmeichhiate chuan Petera leh a ṭhiante hnênah an va sawi vat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chu Isua ṭhiante hnênah a kal a, mitthi ngaia an ṭap lai chu a va hrilh a. Chumi hnu chuan, Isua ngeiin, anmahni hmangin, chatuan chhandamna thu ril thianghlim leh chhe thei lo chu, chhak leh thlang, ram tinah a theh darh ta a. Amen)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, a nung leh a, hmuh pawh a hmu tih an han hriat pawhin an awih chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan an zînga mi pahnih, thingtlâng khaw lam pan laite hnênah pawh, hmêl danglam puin a inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anni pawh chuan mi dangte chu an rawn hrilh a; mahse, an lo awih chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Sâwmpakhatte hnênah, chaw an kîl laiin a inlâr a, a tholeh hmutute thu an awih loh avângin an rin loh leh an thinlung sak kawngah chuan a zilhhau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hnênah, “Khawvêl ram zawng zawngah kal ula, thil siam tinrêng hnênah Chanchin Ṭha hi hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu pawh a ringa, baptisma chang chu chhandam an ni ang a, tu pawh a ring lo chuan thiam loh an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng chhinchhiahna thil makte hi ringtute zîngah a awm zêl ang: Ka hmingin ramhuaite an hnawt chhuak ang a, ṭawng thartein an ṭawng ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kutin rûlte an man ang a, thihna tûr eng pawh in mah se, eng mah an ti lo vang; damlote chungah kut an nghat ang a, an dam zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, an hnêna thu a sawi zawhin Lalpa Isua chu vâna hruai chhohvin a awm a, Pathian ding lamah a han ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anni pawh chu an chhuak a, ram tinah thu an hril ta a, Lalpan anmahni a thawhpui a, an thu chu chhinchhiahna thil maktein a tinghet zui zêl a. Amen.)
  </para>
</usx>
